s with an in-process Aho-Corasick string-matching automaton running on the request thread.","Reduced GPU compute 10x by gating a Qwen2.5-1.5B LoRA (Low-Rank Adaptation) adapter on a free Hugging Face Space at authority 0.5.","Implemented RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) over company embeddings with pgvector vector search and prompt engineering, validated by an evaluation harness.","Integrated Resend outbound with HMAC-SHA256-verified inbound webhooks via an MX (Mail eXchange) catch-all alias, classifying replies into 6 buckets.","Shipped an 8-rule strategy enforcer that blocks CI/CD merges on failed evals, ungrounded LLM calls, taxonomy drift, and missing human-in-the-loop checkpoints.","Ranked leads with 18-feature vector embeddings via cosine similarity against an ICP centroid, blended with recency and completeness, filtered at p60.","Evaluated rankers on a golden dataset with accuracy, precision, recall, F1, AUC-ROC, and nDCG@10 metrics.","Classified decision-makers from LinkedIn profiles with Machine Learning-derived seniority, department, and authority scoring on a 0.10-1.0 scale.","Validated every LLM enrichment with Zod (TypeScript) and Pydantic (Python) schemas before persistence to PostgreSQL.","Architected multi-agent ICP scoring with debate and a 6-specialist competitor analysis graph for differentiation and threat assessment.","Gated AI classifications with asymmetric per-tier confidence thresholds (not-AI 0.65, AI-first 0.72, AI-native 0.80)."]},{"id":"0","name":"ResearchThera.com","description":"AI clinical-intelligence platform for families: LlamaIndex RAG chat over hybrid pgvector and full-text search screens iatrogenic symptoms and orchestrates 23 LangGraph workflows for medication safety and academic retrieval.","githubUrl":"","websiteUrl":"https://researchthera.com","highlights":["Architected a 5-stage LlamaIndex chat pipeline routing 9 intents, retriaging on low confidence, and terminating in a safety auditor.","Engineered hybrid retrieval across 8 pgvector indices, each fronted by a typed BaseRetriever so triage hits only the needed corpora.","Integrated academic retrieval across OpenAlex, Crossref, and Semantic Scholar with cross-encoder rerank gates at 0.75, 0.55, and 0.72.","Persisted medication evidence from DailyMed, openFDA, and RxNav into 6 pharmacology tables behind a 30-day cache for reproducible lookups.","Implemented a regimen interaction screen for pairwise drug-drug conflicts and ATC level-3 duplicate-therapy clusters, scoring severity none through high.","Designed an iatrogenic-first psych screen with a drug-washout phase classifier and a critique-refine loop rewriting axes under 7 of 10.","Shipped a 3-tier lab-PDF parser emitting per-test, per-marker, and derived health-state nodes into a longitudinal patient record.","Scaled an Apollo Server 5 layer to 217 resolvers over a 90-table Drizzle ORM schema, enforcing GraphQL-only client traffic.","Productionized two Vercel-AI SDK agents emitting Zod-validated outputs to Cloudflare R2: a CYOA narrator and a CBT/ACT/DBT/MBSR therapeutic generator.","Built a Python FastAPI async backend with Pydantic schemas and observability tracing for fault-tolerant, distributed deployment."]}]},"volunteer":[{"id":"1","organization":"Nautilus Trader","position":"Open-Source Contributor -- Algorithmic Trading Engine","url":"https://github.com/nautechsystems/nautilus_trader/pulls?q=is%3Apr+is%3Aclosed+author%3Av9ai","startDate":"April 2025","endDate":null,"summary":"<ul><li>Contributed 100+ pull requests to core trading engine and exchange connectivity modules in Rust and Python.</li><li>Built production exchange adapters for dYdX v4 and Hyperliquid with REST, WebSocket, gRPC, authentication, rate limiting, and execution clients.</li><li>Enhanced OKX and Kraken integrations with historical data support, pagination, and WebSocket reliability improvements.</li><li>Implemented high-performance technical indicators in Rust with Python/Cython parity, improving PnL c